  "/*! declined: ...but only then */.t96{transform:matrix3d(20,20,0,0,40,40,0,0,0,0,1,5,80,80,0,1)}",
  "/*! webpack: a 2D pair of 1 leaves the z scale alone */.t97{transform:scaleZ(1.5)}",
  "/*! webpack: a zero time keeps a unit, and \`s\` is the shorter one it can carry */.t98{transition-duration:0s}",
  "/*! webpack: a shorthand slot holding its own initial goes, and a slot taking a
   length or a color is read by the classes a sibling's own value is in — every
   slot holding its initial leaves the shortest of them saying all of them */.t98a{border:none}.t98b{column-rule:none}.t98c{border:solid red}",
  "/*! declined: a sibling filling the slot keeps the initial there */.t98d{border:medium 1px}.t98e{border:currentcolor red}",
  "/*! webpack: a component spelling the property's own initial says nothing beside
   another — omitting its group leaves exactly that keyword */.t99{grid-auto-flow:dense}",
  "/*! declined: the other alternative of the group is not the initial */.t99a{grid-auto-flow:column dense}",
  "/*! declined: no engine reads \`balance\`, and a shorthand carrying one value the
   engine cannot read is dropped whole — taking \`flex-direction\` with it */.flex-balance{flex-direction:column;flex-wrap:balance;display:flex}",
  "/*! the same pair merges where both values are ones an engine reads */.flex-wrap{flex-flow:column wrap;display:flex}",
  "/*! declined: \`initial\` is resolved before \`zoom\` scales a length, so the
   keyword it would be replaced by is a different computed value under one */.initial-length{border-top-width:initial;outline-width:initial;font-size:initial}",
  "/*! a keyword that is not a length is the value \`initial\` computes to */.initial-keyword{float:none;display:inline}",
  "/*! \`mdn-data\` writes this one's initial as prose, so the keyword is supplemented */.initial-prose{text-align:start}",
  "/*! scientific: an exponent is written plainly where that is no longer */.sci01{opacity:2;width:.001px;line-height:2.5;font-weight:400}",
  "/*! scientific: ...else on an integer mantissa */.sci02{width:1e4px;margin-left:15e-8px;transition-duration:1s}",
  "/*! scientific: an integer property keeps a <number>, which it throws out */.sci03{z-index:2e0;column-count:3e0;order:1e0}",
]
`;
